1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,730
Welcome to your Drive practice.

2
00:00:02,730 --> 00:00:08,320
This is a brand-new account. It starts empty, and nothing you do here is saved.

3
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:16,380
Everything begins with the New button. Create a folder, give it a name, and it appears in My Drive.

4
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:24,110
To upload, drag files from your computer onto the page, or choose File upload from the New menu.

5
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:30,760
Drag a file onto a folder to move it. Changed your mind? Choose Undo.

6
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:36,310
Double-click a folder to open it. The path at the top shows where you are.

7
00:00:36,440 --> 00:00:44,380
Right-click any item for more options: rename it, share it, star it, or move it.

8
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:54,020
Sharing is practice too. Add an email address, choose a role, and send. No email ever leaves this page.

9
00:00:54,020 --> 00:01:02,560
The New button also creates Google Docs, Sheets and Slides. They open in a simple practice editor.

10
00:01:03,940 --> 00:01:09,810
Use search to find anything by name, then filter the results by type.

11
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:17,120
Deleted items go to Trash. From there, you can restore them, or delete them forever.

12
00:01:19,670 --> 00:01:25,650
Practice tasks tracks what you have tried. It shows progress, not a score.

13
00:01:25,650 --> 00:01:31,010
Reload the page at any time to start again with a fresh, empty account.

14
00:01:31,380 --> 00:01:34,010
Your turn — Begin Practice.
